          "body": "Started on Spitfire wings over Kent in 1940, lifted onto parkas and scooters a generation later. The mod roundel is the sharpest mark in British street culture: same circle, same defiance. Our version hides the whole story inside: every ring is built from the word BLITZSPIRIT, repeated like a drumbeat. [PLACEHOLDER: REPLACE WITH FINAL COPY]"
